<main class="pc" data-product-core="your-cranium"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS / 01 / Personal Navigator</p><h1>你注意到了什么？</h1><p class="pc-lead">选择想观察的方面。这不是测试或评分。</p><div class="pc-steps" role="navigation" aria-label="CRANIO"><a href="../your-cranium/" aria-current="page">01 · Personal Navigator</a><a href="../configuration/">02 · Configuration</a><a href="../potential/">03 · Potential</a></div><section class="pc-section"><div class="pc-grid"><div class="pc-card"><fieldset><legend>身体</legend><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="头部活动自由度" value="physical-1"><span>头部活动自由度</span></label><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="颈部用力感" value="physical-2"><span>颈部用力感</span></label><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="一天结束时的舒适度" value="physical-3"><span>一天结束时的舒适度</span></label></fieldset></div><div class="pc-card"><fieldset><legend>认知</legend><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="持续注意力" value="cognitive-1"><span>持续注意力</span></label><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="脑力疲劳" value="cognitive-2"><span>脑力疲劳</span></label><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="清晰感" value="cognitive-3"><span>清晰感</span></label></fieldset></div><div class="pc-card"><fieldset><legend>情绪</legend><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="紧张感" value="emotional-1"><span>紧张感</span></label><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="放松能力" value="emotional-2"><span>放松能力</span></label><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="对自身状态的感知" value="emotional-3"><span>对自身状态的感知</span></label></fieldset></div><div class="pc-card"><fieldset><legend>职业</legend><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="工作时的舒适度" value="professional-1"><span>工作时的舒适度</span></label><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="工作负荷" value="professional-2"><span>工作负荷</span></label><label class="pc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-observation="工作后的恢复" value="professional-3"><span>工作后的恢复</span></label></fieldset></div></div><p data-js hidden>已选: <output data-count>0</output></p><div class="pc-actions"><button type="button" data-reset data-js hidden>重置</button><button type="button" data-save data-js hidden>保存到设备</button></div><p class="pc-note">无自动传输；导出本地 JSON 文件。</p><a class="pc-link" href="../../ru/recognition/">扩展清单：137项（俄语） ↗</a></section><section class="pc-section"><div class="pc-actions"><a class="pc-button primary" href="../configuration/">继续 · Configuration ↗</a><a class="pc-button" href="../start/">讨论你的情况</a></div><details class="pc-legacy"><summary>既有内容</summary><section class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">CRANIO / Your CRANIO</p><h2>Your CRANIO</h2><p class="lead">你的头部与颈部，是你所生活的更大系统的一部分。</p></section><section class="band"><h2>Your CRANIO 是个人观察入口，用来理解当前配置并持续记录变化。</h2><p>OBSERVE → CALIBRATE → IDENTIFY → OPTIMIZE → VERIFY</p></section></details></section></main>